close_reason: "templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts now counts an entry at node_modules/pm-ops (lstat, so a dangling link counts) as present when the package.json probe fails with MODULE_NOT_FOUND, and rethrows the original resolution error. Two new fixture cases in test/merge-driver-launcher.test.ts fail against the previous template and pass now; the omit-dev case still skips with exactly one notice. node --test test/merge-driver-launcher.test.ts: 10/10; npm run release:check exits 0."
body: ""
